  "camel_example": "aliyun cs POST /clusters/ce0da5a1d627e4e9e9f96cae8ad000000/checks --region cn-hangzhou --header \"Content-Type=application/json\" --body '{\"options\":{\"key\":\"example-string\"},\"type\":\"NodePoolUpgrade\",\"target\":\"np1f6779297c4444a3a1cdd29be8000000\"}'",
  "cmd_full_name": "cs run-cluster-check",
  "cmd_name": "run-cluster-check",
  "deprecated": false,
  "description_en": "The intelligent O&M platform for containers provides a wide range of Kubernetes cluster check capabilities, including cluster upgrade checks, cluster migration checks, component installation checks, component upgrade checks, and node pool checks. Before an upgrade, migration, or installation operation is performed, the platform automatically triggers a check. You can perform the change operation only after the check is passed. You can also manually call the RunClusterCheck operation to perform a cluster check. Periodically check and maintain your clusters to prevent security risks",
  "description_zh": "容器智能运维平台提供丰富的Kubernetes集群检查能力，包括集群升级检查、集群迁移检查、组件安装检查、组件升级检查、节点池检查等。在正式执行升级、迁移或安装操作前，容器智能运维平台会自动触发检查，仅当检查通过后您才可以执行变更操作。您也可以手动调用RunClusterCheck接口执行集群检查。建议您定期对集群进行检查和维护，预防集群安全风险",
  "kebab_example": "aliyun cs run-cluster-check --cluster-id ce0da5a1d627e4e9e9f96cae8ad000000 --type NodePoolUpgrade --target np1f6779297c4444a3a1cdd29be8000000 --options key=example-string --region cn-hangzhou",
